#STRINGS.UI.ARK_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.CHONGYUE.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.ARK_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.CHONGYUE.1.1"
msgid "Deals 210% ATK as Physical damage to the target. When at maximum charges, removes all charges and deals damage for each charge removed\nMax 3 charges"
msgstr "-下次普通攻击对目标造成攻击力200%的物理伤害\n-技能达到最大充能层数时消耗所有充能，造成对应次数的伤害\n-限制空手触发\n-可充能3次"

