msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.ARK_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.CHONGYUE.3.1"
msgid "Deals 260% ATK as Physical damage to the target and nearby enemies; after this skill has been used 5 times, Chongyue's attack range increases and attacks hit twice; this skill becomes auto-activated and deals damage an extra time"
msgstr "-下次普通攻击对目标及其周围造成相当于攻击力260%的物理伤害\n-累计使用五次技能攻击的范围扩大且攻击变为二连击，技能变为自动释放且造成额外一次伤害\n-限制空手触发"

